{"id":"memorial_102704","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial102700","label":"Data · Rapture Anomaly Report - Part 1"},"label":"Rapture Anomaly Report 04","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_102703","next":"memorial_102705","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_102704_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"Some wild animals are getting close to the battlefield."},{"id":"memorial_102704_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"I don't know much about animals."},{"id":"memorial_102704_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"Are those deer? Or elk?"},{"id":"memorial_102704_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"At any rate, 6 animals are roving on the battlefield now."},{"id":"memorial_102704_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"If peace and quiet are what they're after, they chose the perfect place."},{"id":"memorial_102704_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_27_04_description","text":"Then again, considering everyone's dead, it's no surprise that it's so quiet out here. Har har har."}]}